<title>ITALY: ALPINE SKIING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS TIMETABLE.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS TIMETABLE.</headline>
<dateline>SESTRIERE, Italy 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The opening race of the</p>
<p>Alpine skiing world championships is the men's super-G on</p>
<p>Monday. The following is the full timetable:</p>
<p>    Feb 2   - Opening ceremony (1800 GMT)</p>
<p>    Feb 3   - Men's super-G (1200)</p>
<p>    Feb 4   - Men's downhill training (1200)</p>
<p>    Feb 5   - Men's downhill training (1200)</p>
<p>		  Women's slalom (first leg 1700, second 2000)</p>
<p>    Feb 6   - Men's combined downhill (1100)</p>
<p>		  Men's combined slalom (1700 and 2000)</p>
<p>    Feb 7   - Men's downhill training (1200)</p>
<p>    Feb 8   - Men's downhill (1200)</p>
<p>    Feb 9   - Women's giant slalom (0900 and 1200)</p>
<p>Feb 10  - Women's downhill training (1200)</p>
<p>Feb 11  - Women's super-G (1200)</p>
<p>Feb 12  - Men's giant slalom (0900 and 1200)</p>
<p>		- Women's downhill training (1100)</p>
<p>Feb 13  - Women's combined downhill (1100)</p>
<p>		- Women's combined slalom (1700 and 2000)</p>
<p>Feb 14  - Women's downhill training (1200)</p>
<p>Feb 15  - Women's downhill (1200)</p>
<p>		- Men's slalom (1700 and 2000)</p>
<p>		- Closing ceremony (2130)</p>
</text>
